WEBVTT

01:40.810 --> 01:45.630
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.390 --> 01:50.810
[Episode 16]

02:07.230 --> 02:08.830
They have a point.

02:09.080 --> 02:11.800
You've only known them for a few days.

02:11.960 --> 02:14.000
Is it really worth the risk to go with them?

02:14.000 --> 02:16.520
Listen to them and go sightseeing instead.

02:21.590 --> 02:24.000
Anyway, I really should thank you.

02:25.190 --> 02:26.530
Thank you for treating my cousin

02:26.530 --> 02:28.070
and Mr. Wangquan.

02:28.400 --> 02:29.190
Thank you,

02:29.870 --> 02:30.710
Miss Cuiyu.

02:31.120 --> 02:32.000
Thank me?

02:34.960 --> 02:35.800
Well...

02:37.110 --> 02:39.240
how about repaying me with your heart?

02:39.770 --> 02:40.570
Miss Cuiyu...

02:45.280 --> 02:46.340
Miss Cuiyu,

02:47.000 --> 02:49.200
this joke is a bit much, don't you think?

02:55.360 --> 02:56.480
Dummy,

02:57.150 --> 02:58.190
don't you think

02:59.280 --> 03:02.030
you might like me a little bit?

03:30.579 --> 03:32.460
Your heart's beating so fast.

03:33.390 --> 03:34.780
That means yes.

03:36.590 --> 03:37.520
Great.

03:39.870 --> 03:40.870
Next question.

03:41.160 --> 03:43.280
Which version of me do you actually like?

03:43.280 --> 03:45.520
The red-eyed Cuiyu Mingluan

03:45.710 --> 03:47.360
or the blue-eyed one?

03:50.010 --> 03:51.210
Aren't they both you?

03:51.280 --> 03:52.280
Of course not.

03:52.710 --> 03:53.960
She's her, I'm me.

03:54.530 --> 03:56.530
Think carefully before you answer.

03:56.590 --> 03:58.000
Don't get it wrong.

03:58.780 --> 04:00.360
And what counts as a right answer?

04:00.360 --> 04:01.710
You tell me.

04:04.630 --> 04:06.120
You already have the answer in your heart.

04:06.120 --> 04:07.320
How else can I answer?

04:07.870 --> 04:10.320
You're teasing me, and that's not fair.

04:11.030 --> 04:12.520
How am I teasing you?

04:15.710 --> 04:17.990
Red Eyes always acts too intensely.

04:18.269 --> 04:20.269
It's time for Blue Eyes to take over.

04:22.000 --> 04:23.130
You answered wrong.

04:24.510 --> 04:27.120
So you do prefer the gentleness of Blue Eyes.

04:32.240 --> 04:34.640
Girls don't necessarily have to be gentle.

04:35.360 --> 04:36.520
But as humans,

04:38.870 --> 04:40.330
we should at least be kind.

04:41.360 --> 04:42.190
I'm not human.

04:42.310 --> 04:43.270
I'm a demon.

04:43.720 --> 04:45.250
The same applies to demons.

04:51.430 --> 04:52.240
Alright then.

04:53.870 --> 04:55.130
I know your answer now.

05:07.690 --> 05:09.220
Take care, Miss Cuiyu.

05:11.390 --> 05:13.040
I wonder when

05:14.690 --> 05:16.310
we'll meet again.

05:23.830 --> 05:24.630
Cousin,

05:25.480 --> 05:27.540
I know you don't want me to take risks,

05:28.680 --> 05:30.680
but I can't stop worrying about you.

05:56.409 --> 05:58.010
Why didn't you let me out?

05:58.750 --> 06:00.630
Why didn't you let me see Mr. Mu?

06:00.720 --> 06:01.510
Shut up.

06:02.360 --> 06:04.160
You're becoming more and more extreme.

06:04.160 --> 06:05.070
Be careful,

06:05.160 --> 06:07.000
don't let Golden Dawn influence you.

06:07.000 --> 06:08.680
Shut up!

06:09.360 --> 06:10.680
With Mr. Mu's character,

06:10.680 --> 06:12.750
he would never abandon his cousin.

06:13.500 --> 06:17.830
He deliberately pushed you away because he was worried you might be in danger.

06:18.390 --> 06:19.720
How do you know that?

06:20.410 --> 06:22.300
He likes you

06:23.040 --> 06:25.240
because you're gentle and kind, right?

06:25.360 --> 06:28.020
We can talk about what's between us later.

06:28.160 --> 06:30.120
Right now, the priority is Mr. Mu.

06:44.420 --> 06:45.630
What are you doing?

06:46.490 --> 06:48.420
You like Dummy too, don't you?

06:51.010 --> 06:54.250
You heard the questions I asked him today.

06:55.360 --> 06:56.560
He likes us.

06:58.390 --> 06:59.750
To be precise,

07:00.160 --> 07:01.680
he likes you.

07:02.950 --> 07:04.240
Just like you,

07:04.430 --> 07:06.800
he thinks I'm a frightening monster.

07:07.920 --> 07:09.380
We don't think that of you.

07:09.390 --> 07:10.360
"We?"

07:11.620 --> 07:13.000
What a "we."

07:13.600 --> 07:15.070
Are you two a couple now?

07:15.430 --> 07:16.310
What?

07:16.720 --> 07:18.630
From now on, with him protecting you,

07:18.630 --> 07:20.510
you don't need me anymore, do you?

07:24.470 --> 07:26.270
So this really is what you think.

07:26.390 --> 07:27.560
Therefore,

07:27.720 --> 07:29.720
it's your turn to repay me.

07:38.630 --> 07:39.740
What are you doing?

07:43.870 --> 07:45.940
I'm going to make you sleep forever,

07:46.360 --> 07:47.560
never to wake up.

07:56.240 --> 07:57.720
You're so weak,

07:58.390 --> 07:59.750
so incompetent.

08:00.950 --> 08:02.880
Why are you the one who has his love?

08:03.630 --> 08:06.630
And why should you get to have our body all to yourself?

08:06.950 --> 08:07.800
Why?

08:24.600 --> 08:26.720
My craftsmanship from 20 years ago

08:27.500 --> 08:28.660
is really rough.

08:30.270 --> 08:31.800
But if you give me some time,

08:32.789 --> 08:33.840
I can fix it.

08:37.440 --> 08:40.610
But there's nothing I can do about Huaizhu

08:43.120 --> 08:45.250
being controlled by the demonic aura.

08:49.510 --> 08:51.170
I will definitely wake her up.

08:51.840 --> 08:54.370
I won't let her be consumed by the demonic aura

08:54.510 --> 08:56.080
and turned into the Black Fox's vessel.

08:56.080 --> 08:57.360
According to what you said,

08:57.360 --> 09:00.720
the fragments of the Golden Dawn are refined using the life of demons.

09:00.720 --> 09:01.720
Above that magical artifact,

09:01.720 --> 09:04.080
there must be the Soul Summoning Umbrella of the Netherworld Clan.

09:04.080 --> 09:05.740
The Soul Summoning Umbrella?

09:06.000 --> 09:08.200
This umbrella can purify resentment.

09:08.670 --> 09:12.000
Perhaps it can also purify the demonic aura inside Huaizhu.

09:13.120 --> 09:14.980
But I must first deal with Jiuhuo.

09:16.030 --> 09:18.000
He is the root of all this chaos.

09:18.750 --> 09:19.600
Don't worry.

09:20.870 --> 09:22.320
I've sent people to obtain

09:22.320 --> 09:25.120
the dragon's blood you wanted, no matter the cost.

09:25.600 --> 09:27.200
It's already on its way here.

09:27.870 --> 09:29.270
Jiuhuo is injured.

09:30.130 --> 09:33.190
Tomorrow night at midnight will be his weakest moment.

09:33.390 --> 09:34.750
We'll act then.

09:41.910 --> 09:44.390
Tomorrow's battle will be the final one.

09:45.840 --> 09:46.750
Huaizhu,

09:47.630 --> 09:49.490
I will definitely bring you back.

10:08.270 --> 10:09.910
Wangquan Hongye,

10:11.630 --> 10:13.240
are you ready?

10:28.150 --> 10:29.080
Lord Jiuhuo,

10:29.960 --> 10:33.620
all the first generation elders of the Netherworld Clan are here.

10:36.870 --> 10:39.450
Greetings, Lord Jiuhuo.

10:39.550 --> 10:41.510
You are all my clan members.

10:42.240 --> 10:43.550
If I had other choices,

10:43.550 --> 10:45.510
I wouldn't have to kill you.

11:02.210 --> 11:05.290
My Lord, you're doing this out of necessity.

11:07.090 --> 11:10.430
To die for you is our honor.

11:12.850 --> 11:14.430
Without the leech demon,

11:14.870 --> 11:16.270
this is the only way

11:16.290 --> 11:18.790
to fix the last gap in the Golden Dawn.

11:31.270 --> 11:32.330
Jia Lan,

11:33.960 --> 11:35.960
we will meet again eventually.

12:25.690 --> 12:26.850
Jiuhuo,

12:27.080 --> 12:29.440
your demonic power is boundless, daring to fight against heaven.

12:29.440 --> 12:30.960
Why are you hiding

12:31.490 --> 12:32.860
now that I'm here?

12:33.630 --> 12:35.030
Wangquan Hongye,

12:36.240 --> 12:38.240
are you here to seek death?

12:39.250 --> 12:41.280
You didn't even spare Ye Yuan.

12:41.400 --> 12:43.290
You actually took his demon core.

12:43.560 --> 12:47.170
Since when did you have the right to judge me?

12:48.180 --> 12:49.640
How pathetic you are.

12:53.270 --> 12:54.630
Eighteen years ago,

12:55.000 --> 12:57.460
you left the Boundary to fight the Black Fox,

12:57.600 --> 12:59.990
and the Mask Group was nearly wiped out.

13:02.600 --> 13:04.020
And all of it

13:05.240 --> 13:07.540
was because of your arrogance.

13:08.940 --> 13:11.160
Aren't you pathetic?

13:16.740 --> 13:19.650
I won't give you another chance.

14:09.240 --> 14:09.910
Hongye!

14:28.370 --> 14:30.650
Quzhuo, you're as slow as ever.

14:33.000 --> 14:35.790
You think these old, weak, and wounded people

14:36.440 --> 14:38.650
are worthy of fighting me?

14:38.910 --> 14:39.750
Hongye,

14:39.980 --> 14:40.910
catch the sword!

14:57.010 --> 14:58.170
I'll kill you first.

15:16.610 --> 15:19.810
There's a vast gap in power between us.

15:19.900 --> 15:22.480
So what if you're using Clairvoyance?

15:57.720 --> 15:58.510
Quzhuo!

15:59.960 --> 16:00.790
Zui!

16:05.270 --> 16:06.460
Dragon blood?

16:43.950 --> 16:45.320
You fools.

16:45.590 --> 16:48.630
If you hadn't tried to save this crippled old man just now,

16:48.630 --> 16:50.890
you might still have had a chance to live.

17:25.720 --> 17:27.319
But now your sword is broken,

17:27.319 --> 17:29.120
and the dragon's blood is gone.

17:29.510 --> 17:31.360
What can you do now?

17:36.290 --> 17:37.290
Mu Mie.

17:52.140 --> 17:53.340
Miss Cuiyu.

17:54.790 --> 17:56.590
You, a leech demon,

17:56.610 --> 18:00.070
dare to stand against me for them?

18:00.260 --> 18:01.720
As long as I can protect him,

18:01.720 --> 18:04.520
I don't care if I have to stand against even heaven!

18:09.010 --> 18:12.730
You dare use the power of the Golden Dawn against me?

18:45.200 --> 18:47.440
Dummy, you're already gravely injured.

18:47.440 --> 18:49.310
If you use that move again, it will kill you!

18:49.310 --> 18:49.880
Hurry!

19:33.840 --> 19:34.350
Hongye!

19:35.000 --> 19:35.510
Hongye!

19:47.750 --> 19:48.590
Dragon blood?

19:55.970 --> 19:57.300
Young Master Wangquan!

20:12.400 --> 20:13.350
Unite as one!

20:13.460 --> 20:14.340
Form the array!

21:35.660 --> 21:36.670
Tell me,

21:36.700 --> 21:38.380
what can restrain you?

21:38.680 --> 21:40.120
Dragon bones and dragon blood.

21:40.120 --> 21:42.090
The bane of the Netherworld Clan

21:42.590 --> 21:44.240
is the Dragon Clan.

21:44.620 --> 21:46.430
I see.

21:52.200 --> 21:54.330
Do you really think you can win?

22:36.880 --> 22:38.110
Huaizhu?

22:47.260 --> 22:48.660
Lord Jiuhuo,

22:49.240 --> 22:51.960
how does it feel

22:52.590 --> 22:53.850
to taste defeat again?

22:56.640 --> 22:58.240
You're not Jia Lan,

22:58.890 --> 23:00.650
nor are you Huaizhu.

23:01.720 --> 23:03.880
You've been plotting all along.

23:04.510 --> 23:06.370
When the mandala flower bloomed,

23:06.610 --> 23:08.840
a new personality formed within you.

23:11.990 --> 23:13.190
Ridiculous.

23:13.850 --> 23:15.250
So ridiculous.

23:19.240 --> 23:20.110
Huaizhu!

23:28.650 --> 23:30.320
Who is your Huaizhu?

23:45.270 --> 23:46.830
Love is a curse.

23:47.680 --> 23:48.680
Love

23:49.230 --> 23:51.470
is the weakness of all of you.

24:17.960 --> 24:18.750
Hongye!

24:18.750 --> 24:19.270
Hongye!

24:19.270 --> 24:20.600
Young Master Wangquan!

24:23.880 --> 24:24.930
Now,

24:25.040 --> 24:29.450
do you still believe that Dongfang Huaizhu still exists?

24:31.120 --> 24:33.470
What exactly do you want to do?

24:35.110 --> 24:36.960
What do I want to do?

24:38.460 --> 24:41.460
I am the bad seed formed from the countless grievances

24:44.650 --> 24:48.710
and resentments gathered from the Grief Tree on Tushan.

24:49.920 --> 24:51.070
What do you think

24:52.030 --> 24:53.720
I want to do?

25:12.730 --> 25:14.540
There is goodness in the world,

25:14.830 --> 25:16.490
so why can't there be evil?

25:17.700 --> 25:19.690
Since I was born to be evil,

25:19.940 --> 25:21.940
why must I have love?

25:22.200 --> 25:24.730
This is why Jia Lan failed.

25:25.750 --> 25:28.230
Fortunately, I am not her.

25:31.920 --> 25:33.170
You...

25:34.160 --> 25:36.380
You've been lying to me all along.

25:37.200 --> 25:40.530
If I hadn't made you believe Dongfang Huaizhu still exists,

25:40.600 --> 25:42.510
how could you have risked your life

25:42.510 --> 25:44.120
to help me get rid of Jiuhuo?

25:48.770 --> 25:50.200
Does it hurt?

25:52.400 --> 25:53.350
Then hate me.

25:58.860 --> 26:02.670
Your hatred is my best nourishment.

26:32.630 --> 26:34.800
All demons in the world

26:34.960 --> 26:37.310
are at my command.

26:38.790 --> 26:40.270
My servants,

26:41.850 --> 26:45.690
offer yourselves for me.

27:32.360 --> 27:33.940
I am not Jia Lan,

27:33.960 --> 27:36.170
nor am I Dongfang Huaizhu.

27:38.350 --> 27:40.200
I am who I am.

27:43.320 --> 27:46.330
I will be the one and only mandala flower

27:47.240 --> 27:50.960
on the black Grief Tree.

28:13.510 --> 28:14.240
Where are we?

28:14.310 --> 28:15.230
Where am I?

28:16.920 --> 28:17.760
Run!

28:27.550 --> 28:29.080
What are you trying to do?

28:29.770 --> 28:31.300
If we cannot live together,

28:31.570 --> 28:33.370
then let us die together!

28:34.130 --> 28:35.540
I bet

28:36.000 --> 28:38.020
Dongfang Huaizhu is still here.

28:53.330 --> 28:59.420
♪ All my wild wishes can never come true ♪

29:00.450 --> 29:06.500
♪ If we part ways, how clear-headed would I be on my own? ♪

29:01.570 --> 29:04.010
This umbrella can purify resentment.

29:04.440 --> 29:07.230
Perhaps it can also purify the demonic aura inside Huaizhu.

29:07.100 --> 29:13.070
♪ With this body and heart I search ♪

29:13.620 --> 29:16.790
♪ Kindling fire with love ♪

29:17.780 --> 29:20.880
♪ It neither dims nor extinguished ♪

29:32.310 --> 29:33.840
Today, I, Wangquan Hongye,

29:33.880 --> 29:35.510
will ignite my sword with my life,

29:35.510 --> 29:37.560
determined to break this deadlock!

30:44.190 --> 30:45.420
Come back,

30:46.400 --> 30:47.680
Dongfang Huaizhu.

31:03.100 --> 31:04.380
Come back,

31:05.880 --> 31:07.740
Dongfang Huaizhu.

31:36.420 --> 31:41.380
♪ You cut my hair with your sword ♪

31:43.710 --> 31:48.360
♪ Obsessively, you broke into my world ♪

31:50.290 --> 31:52.480
♪ Flames awakened by blood on your fingertip ♪

31:53.170 --> 31:56.120
♪ Curl around your blade ♪

31:57.000 --> 31:59.560
♪ In this mortal world, I drink a pot of wine ♪

32:00.160 --> 32:01.840
♪ To cleave heaven and earth ♪

32:02.590 --> 32:04.630
♪ I just need one swing of the sword ♪

32:05.340 --> 32:07.110
♪ You stood before me ♪

32:07.590 --> 32:10.280
♪ And my heart stopped in that instant ♪

32:10.960 --> 32:15.420
♪ Where are you now? ♪

32:17.240 --> 32:19.290
♪ Perhaps the Bamboo Pavilion by the Huai River ♪

32:19.620 --> 32:20.990
♪ On the Seventh of July ♪

32:21.290 --> 32:23.560
♪ Was only a dream ♪

32:24.110 --> 32:26.000
♪ Perhaps my longing ♪

32:26.380 --> 32:27.590
♪ And dreams ♪

32:28.160 --> 32:30.160
♪ Will never have an ending ♪

32:31.170 --> 32:32.790
♪ Perhaps, years later ♪

32:33.610 --> 32:34.560
♪ On another Qixi ♪

32:35.090 --> 32:37.190
♪ Neither of us will be there ♪

32:38.040 --> 32:39.700
♪ Perhaps we'll be worlds apart ♪

32:40.200 --> 32:43.400
♪ Not even buried together ♪

32:46.820 --> 32:48.840
♪ All the impossibilities ♪

32:50.170 --> 32:52.520
♪ And the sincere heart I gave you ♪

32:53.770 --> 32:55.750
♪ Every trace of love ♪

32:57.310 --> 32:59.300
♪ I walk on clouds with my sword, and it rains on a clear day ♪

33:00.520 --> 33:02.480
♪ You are the most breathtaking sight in this world ♪
